Notes on third-party material:

- This project is inspired by and pays homage to Sam Chiet's Desktop Goose
  (https://samperson.itch.io/desktop-goose). It's an independent reimagining
  in Swift, not a fork.
- Goose sprites are not versioned in this repository; see `Goose/ASSETS.md`
  for provenance. Pull them at setup time per `Goose/README.md`.
- Honk audio samples originate from Untitled Goose Game and are not
  redistributed by this repository.
